\ Gurobi-style icators
Minimize
 cost: 3 x + 2 y + m + a
Subject To
 link: x + y + z >= 4
 ind1: b = 1 -> x + y <= 3
 ind2: b = 0 -> x - y >= 1
General Constraints
 gmax: m = MAX ( x , y , 3 )
 gabs: a = ABS ( z )
 gand: r = AND ( b , c )
 gor: s = OR ( b , c )
 gmin: n = MIN ( x , y )
Bounds
 -10 <= z <= 10
 0 <= x <= 20
 0 <= y <= 20
Binaries
 b c r s
